              "name": "content",
              "value": "Demo Electronics — Customer Support Knowledge Base\n\nCOMPANY\nDemo Electronics sells consumer electronics and accessories.\n\nREFUND POLICY\nCustomers can request a refund within 30 days of receiving their order. Products must be returned in their original condition. Refunds are processed within 5–7 business days after the returned product is inspected.\n\nSHIPPING\nStandard shipping takes 3–5 business days. Express shipping takes 1–2 business days. Customers receive a tracking number after their order has been shipped.\n\nWARRANTY\nAll Demo Electronics products have a 12-month warranty against manufacturing defects. The warranty does not cover accidental damage, water damage, or unauthorized repairs.\n\nSUPPORT\nCustomers can contact support for questions about orders, refunds, shipping, warranty and products.\n\nESCALATION\nIf a customer's issue cannot be answered confidently using the knowledge base, the issue should be escalated to a human support representative.",
